INs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Custom backends","anchor":"Custom-backends"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Labels identify categories, such as "},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.FIDO","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Metadata carries details such as byte counts and error codes; the default backend displays","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"these as ","type":"text"},{"code":"key=value","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" pairs. Message wording and metadata keys are not a stable API."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend controls formatting, storage, and export. YubiKit does not retain log messages.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/loggingguide"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"YubiKit"}],"title":"Logging","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"references":{"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit":{"role":"collection","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"documentation-header.png"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Connect and run commands on the different applications on a YubiKey. The framework support connecting using NFC, Lightning and USB."}],"url":"\/documentation\/yubikit","title":"YubiKit"},"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/Logs":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Logs","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/Logs","abstract":[{"text":"Configures logging for Yubi